Description:

JMAP requests are validated more strictly per RFC 8620: duplicate JSON
member names are notJSON; /copy reports fromAccountNotFound, not
accountNotFound, for an unusable fromAccountId; a missing or non-string
sinceState is invalidArguments; and every /set type, including
CalendarEvent and ContactCard, rejects overlapping patch paths (and
Email/set paths below a keyword or mailboxId) with invalidPatch.


Documentation:

RFC 8620 sections 3.6, 5.2, 5.3 and 5.4.


